<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16944" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex-orbĭto</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a.</i> [orbita] (post-class.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to go out of the
			track</i>, <i>to deviate.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exorbitantes boves, qui vehiculum trahebant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Civ. D. 22, 8 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stellis exorbitare a praestitutis itineribus
					non licet,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lact. 2, 5, 12</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a regula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Marc. 3, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a catholicae fidei regulis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 8, 11 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to turn out of the
			track</i>, <i>turn aside;</i> trop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animum a tramite,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 5, 16</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
